  "reason": "A cool paper-white ground, ink-navy structure, and marigold reserved for deadlines and status give HaqPath an official, ledger-like calm that makes verified rules feel checkable rather than promotional.",
  "design_html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n:root {\n  --background: 36.9 61.9% 95.9%;\n  --foreground: 22.5 22.9% 13.7%;\n  --card: 37.5 100.0% 98.4%;\n  --card-foreground: 22.5 22.9% 13.7%;\n  --popover: 37.5 100.0% 98.4%;\n  --popover-foreground: 22.5 22.9% 13.7%;\n  --primary: 14.8 59.2% 40.4%;\n  --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --secondary: 174.9 48.8% 23.7%;\n  --secondary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n  --muted-foreground: 24.0 12.8% 38.2%;\n  --accent: 35.8 78.8% 57.5%;\n  --accent-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n  --destructive: 354.8 54.5% 41.4%;\n  --destructive-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --ring: 14.8 59.2% 40.4%;\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.06);\n  --shadow: 0 4px 12px -2px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.10);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 12px 32px -8px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.14);\n}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:'Manrope',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"hq\"><style>.hq{background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;min-height:100%}.hq *{box-sizing:border-box}.hq a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.hq-wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}.hq-nav{background:hsl(var(--card));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border));position:sticky;top:0}.hq-nav .hq-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:4rem}.hq-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}.hq-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;font-size:.875rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.hq-actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.hq-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;height:2.5rem;padding:0 1.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;border:1px solid hsl(var(--primary))}.hq-btn-o{background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--foreground));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.hq-btn-sm{height:2.25rem;font-size:.875rem;padding:0 .875rem}.hq-hero{padding:5rem 0 3rem}.hq-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));padding:.25rem .75rem;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--card))}.hq-h1{font-size:3.25rem;line-height:1.08;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:1.25rem 0 1rem;max-width:44rem}.hq-lead{font-size:1.125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));max-width:40rem;margin:0 0 2rem}.hq-search{background:hsl(var(--card));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:1.5rem;max-width:48rem}.hq-label{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin-bottom:.5rem;display:block}.hq-row{display:flex;gap:.5rem}.hq-input{flex:1;height:2.875rem;background:hsl(var(--background));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:0 1rem;font-size:1rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground));display:flex;align-items:center}.hq-icon{width:2.875rem;height:2.875rem;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:hsl(var(--background));flex:none}.hq-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1rem;align-items:center;font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.hq-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.125rem .625rem;border-radius:9999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;background:hsl(var(--secondary));color:hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))}.hq-badge-p{background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary))}.hq-badge-d{background:hsl(var(--destructive) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--destructive))}.hq-sec{padding:3.5rem 0;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.hq-kick{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:0 0 .5rem}.hq-h2{font-size:2rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 .5rem}.hq-sub{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0 0 2.5rem;max-width:38rem}.hq-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1rem}.hq-card{background:hsl(var(--card));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:1.5rem}.hq-num{width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1rem}.hq-card h3{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 .375rem}.hq-card p{margin:0;font-size:.9375rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.hq-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.hq-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem}.hq-colhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;padding:0 .25rem}.hq-count{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));font-weight:400}.hq-scheme{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}.hq-scheme h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0}.hq-meta{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0}.hq-why{font-size:.875rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.hq-prog{height:.375rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--muted));overflow:hidden}.hq-prog i{display:block;height:100%;background:hsl(var(--primary));border-radius:9999px}.hq-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem}.hq-list{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:.9375rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.hq-list li{display:flex;gap:.625rem;padding:.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.hq-list li:last-child{border-bottom:0}.hq-list svg{flex:none;margin-top:.25rem}.hq-mono{font-family:inherit}.hq-foot{border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));padding:2.5rem 0;font-size:.875rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.hq-foot .hq-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.hq-foot nav{display:flex;gap:1.25rem}@media(max-width:860px){.hq-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hq-cols,.hq-split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hq-h1{font-size:2.25rem}.hq-links{display:none}}</style> <header class=\"hq-nav\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <a class=\"hq-brand\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--primary))\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7 17V7M7 12h6M13 7v10\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--primary))\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>HaqPath</a> <nav class=\"hq-links\"><a href=\"#\">How it works</a><a href=\"#\">Schemes</a><a href=\"#\">Your checklist</a><a href=\"#\">Trust and data</a></nav> <div class=\"hq-actions\"><a class=\"hq-btn hq-btn-o hq-btn-sm\" href=\"#\">Log in</a><a class=\"hq-btn hq-btn-sm\" href=\"#\">Start free</a></div> </div></header> <section class=\"hq-hero\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <span class=\"hq-eyebrow\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--primary))\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Official sources, plain explanations</span> <h1 class=\"hq-h1\">Find the public scholarships your family may qualify for</h1> <p class=\"hq-lead\">HaqPath is for Class 11–12 students and parents. Describe your situation in one sentence, answer two to four short questions, and see every scheme you may qualify for, with the reason and the official source.</p> <div class=\"hq-search\"> <label class=\"hq-label\" for=\"sit\">Describe your family's situation in one sentence</label> <div class=\"hq-row\"> <div class=\"hq-input\">My father is a daily wage worker and I study in Class 12 in a government school.</div> <span class=\"hq-icon\" aria-label=\"Speak\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--foreground))\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v4\"/></svg></span> <a class=\"hq-btn\" href=\"#\">Check my eligibility</a> </div> <div class=\"hq-chips\"><span>Available in</span><span class=\"hq-badge\">English</span><span class=\"hq-badge\">हिन्दी</span><span class=\"hq-badge\">தமிழ்</span><span>You can also type or speak.</span></div> </div> </div></section> <section class=\"hq-sec\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <p class=\"hq-kick\">How it works</p> <h2 class=\"hq-h2\">From one sentence to a checklist you can act on</h2> <p class=\"hq-sub\">Every match follows published rules, so you can see why a scheme fits and what still needs checking.</p> <div class=\"hq-steps\"> <div class=\"hq-card\"><div class=\"hq-num\">1</div><h3>Describe your situation</h3><p>Speak or type one short sentence in English or your language.</p></div> <div class=\"hq-card\"><div class=\"hq-num\">2</div><h3>Answer a few questions</h3><p>Two to four simple questions. Optional ones can be skipped.</p></div> <div class=\"hq-card\"><div class=\"hq-num\">3</div><h3>Review grouped results</h3><p>Schemes sorted by likelihood, each with a respectful reason.</p></div> <div class=\"hq-card\"><div class=\"hq-num\">4</div><h3>Track your checklist</h3><p>Move each step from Not started to Awaiting outcome.</p></div> </div> </div></section> <section class=\"hq-sec\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <p class=\"hq-kick\">Your results</p> <h2 class=\"hq-h2\">Schemes grouped by how likely they fit</h2> <p class=\"hq-sub\">Change one answer, such as institution type, and HaqPath shows which result moved and the rule behind it.</p> <div class=\"hq-cols\"> <div class=\"hq-col\"> <div class=\"hq-colhead\">Likely eligible <span class=\"hq-count\">2</span></div> <div class=\"hq-card hq-scheme\"><span class=\"hq-badge hq-badge-p\">Likely eligible</span><h3>Post-Matric Scholarship for SC Students</h3><p class=\"hq-meta\">Deadline 31 Oct · Ministry of Social Justice</p><p class=\"hq-why\">Matches income limit and enrolment in a government school.</p><div class=\"hq-prog\"><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></div></div> <div class=\"hq-card hq-scheme\"><span class=\"hq-badge hq-badge-p\">Likely eligible</span><h3>State Merit-cum-Means Award</h3><p class=\"hq-meta\">Deadline 15 Nov · State education portal</p><p class=\"hq-why\">Matches Class 12 status and family income band.</p><div class=\"hq-prog\"><i style=\"width:20%\"></i></div></div> </div> <div class=\"hq-col\"> <div class=\"hq-colhead\">May qualify <span class=\"hq-count\">2</span></div> <div class=\"hq-card hq-scheme\"><span class=\"hq-badge\">May qualify</span><h3>National Means-cum-Merit Scholarship</h3><p class=\"hq-meta\">Needs: marks certificate</p><p class=\"hq-why\">Depends on your Class 10 aggregate, which is not yet checked.</p></div> <div class=\"hq-card hq-scheme\"><span class=\"hq-badge\">May qualify</span><h3>Girls' Education Support Grant</h3><p class=\"hq-meta\">Needs: residence proof</p><p class=\"hq-why\">Depends on district of residence.</p></div> </div> <div class=\"hq-col\"> <div class=\"hq-colhead\">Not currently eligible <span class=\"hq-count\">1</span></div> <div class=\"hq-card hq-scheme\"><span class=\"hq-badge hq-badge-d\">Not currently eligible</span><h3>Central Sector Scholarship</h3><p class=\"hq-meta\">Official source: scholarships.gov.in</p><p class=\"hq-why\">Requires a degree course. You can change institution type to review.</p></div> </div> </div> </div></section> <section class=\"hq-sec\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <p class=\"hq-kick\">Trust and data</p> <h2 class=\"hq-h2\">Clear about how decisions are made</h2> <p class=\"hq-sub\">HaqPath uses transparent, rule-based matching. Your checklist can be shared as a text summary with family, without sensitive details.</p> <div class=\"hq-split\"> <div class=\"hq-card\"><h3>How HaqPath decides</h3><ul class=\"hq-list\"> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--primary))\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Each scheme lists its published rules and official source.</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--primary))\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Results and instructions can be read aloud in your language.</li> </ul></div> <div class=\"hq-card\"><h3>What HaqPath does not collect</h3><ul class=\"hq-list\"> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>Aadhaar numbers, bank details or photographs.</li> <li><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>Your saved checklist ID is <code class=\"hq-mono\">HQ-7F3K-2291</code>, with no personal name.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div></section> <footer class=\"hq-foot\"><div class=\"hq-wrap\"> <span>© 2025 HaqPath. Information from official government sources.</span> <nav><a href=\"#\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#\">Accessibility</a><a href=\"#\">Official sources</a><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></nav> </div></footer> </div>",
